===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{term|frivole|lang=fr}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|frivolus|frīvolus|lang=la|trifling, worthless}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|frivols|'''[[frivolling]]''' or '''[[frivoling]]'''|'''[[frivolled]]''' or '''[[frivoled]]'''}}

# {{intransitive}} To behave [[frivolously]].
